sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant G as Gateway
  participant T as Treadmill simulator
  participant D as SQLite
  B->>G: Acquire lease and arm
  G->>D: Persist armed session
  T->>G: Report physical belt movement
  G->>D: Mark running
  G-->>B: Publish snapshots at 4 Hz
  G->>D: Persist samples at 1 Hz
  B-->>G: Browser disconnects
  Note over G,D: Workout continues locally
  B->>G: Reload and reclaim control
  T->>G: Report physical completion
  G->>D: Persist summary and events
  G-->>B: Show debrief
